msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "BSTS"
msgstr "BSTS"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid ""
"This module offers a Bayesian take on linear Gaussian state space models "
"suitable for   time series analysis."
msgstr ""
"時系列データに適したベイズ流の線形ガウス状態空間モデルを提供するモジュールで"
"す。"

